    "overview": "Graphite + amber is the default identity, approved on 2026-09-30. This is a compact desktop writing tool, with a restrained warm palette and thin borders. Its mark is a folded page containing a bookmark, used in the native icon, favicon, workspace header, search, commands, and empty states.",
